      }, {
        "text": "\n\\cellcolor{white} \\multirow{-3}{*}{3PG (3-Phosphoglycerate)} \u0026 PEP \u0026"
      }, {
        "text": " + (via ENO equilibrium) \\\\\n\\midrule\n\\cellcolor{white} \u0026 3PG \u0026 + \\\\\n"
      }, {
        "text": "\\cellcolor{white} \u0026 PEP \u0026 $-$ (self-limiting) \\\\\n\\cellcolor{white} \\multirow{-"
      }, {
        "text": "3}{*}{PEP (Phosphoenolpyruvate)} \u0026 F16BP \u0026 $-$ (allosteric activation of PK"
      }, {
        "text": ") \\\\\n\\midrule\n\\cellcolor{white} \u0026 PEP \u0026 + \\\\\n\\cellcolor{white} \\multirow"
      }, {
        "text": "{-2}{*}{Pyruvate} \u0026 F16BP \u0026 + (allosteric activation of PK) \\\\\n\\"
      }, {
        "text": "bottomrule\n\\end{tabular}\n\\end{table}\n\n\\end{document}\n```\n\n### Key Differences in"
      }, {
        "text": " the Alternative:\n*   **`\\multirow{-3}{*}{...}`**: Note the negative number. This tells LaTeX to"
